SUMMARY:Mother's Day at Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Bring your own picnic and enoy a peaceful table setting\, fresh air and the charm of the farm at its spring time best. Wander through the Lavender Labyrinth\, stroll the Flower and Butterfly Gardens\, take photos and soak in the peaceful farm atmosphere. Visit the Nursery to shop organic\, pollinator friendly plants or the Farm Stand to shop for Lavender Products.\nWe have two time slots available for table reservations: 11 am to 12:30 pm AND 12:30 pm to 2:00 pm. (2-13 people per reservation)\nAdmission to the farm is free and table reservations are $10 per table. Space is limited so book reservations as soon as possible to make this Mother’s Day truly unforgettable.\nBees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\ninfo@beesnblooms.com\n707-293-8293 \nHome
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/mothers-day-at-bees-n-blooms/
LOCATION:Bees N Blooms\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Other,Recreation
GEO:38.40006;-122.69607
