SUMMARY:Maddy & The Mayors at Brewsters
DESCRIPTION:In this latest musical adventure\, Madeleine (known to many as Maddy) is joined by three talented musicians: drummer/percussionist Bill O’Callaghan\, bass player John Reed\, and harmonica player Peter Lacques. When a friend pointed out that two of the three had previously been mayors of our town\, and the third is the de facto “mayor” of a neighboring town\, the band name was born! \n 
