SUMMARY:Ragtag Sullivan at Lagunitas
DESCRIPTION:Ragtag Sullivan is a North Bay Area vocal-fronted four piece band specializing in blues\, R & B\, rock\, swing and more. Guitarist Jason Bodlovich formed Ragtag and enlisted Phil Herrshaft for vocals and harmonica. The two have a collaboration that dates over 20 years beginning with blues jam sessions at The Valley of the Moon Saloon in Sonoma. Alan Uren and Emily Froberg provide the rhythm section. Repertoire includes a mix of originals and covers by popular artists. Influences include Muddy Waters\, Ray Charles\, Sly & The Family Stone\, Freddie King\, Rolling Stones\, and Jimi Hendrix. \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/ragtag-sullivan-at-lagunitas-2/
LOCATION:Lagunitas Petaluma Taproom\, 1280 N McDowell Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
