SUMMARY:The Gill Brothers Band at HopMonk Sebastopol
DESCRIPTION:KC TURNER PRESENTS \nGILL BROTHERS BAND + Big Kid Fun ft. Caitlin Gowdey of Rainbow Girls \nConnor’s Birthday Bash! \nFrom the idyllic peaks of Cobb Mountain to the far reaches of these United States\, brothers Connor and Jacob Gill have carried the craft of the guitar and song together for over a decade. Formed in 2008\, the band initially dedicated itself to covering artists like Albert King\, ZZ Top\, and AC/DC. After a hiatus during which both brothers engaged in a variety of musical projects\, Gill Brothers Band reformed in the early months of 2020. Since the release of their debut album\, in March 2022\, Gill Brothers Band have toured the west coast extensively\, bringing their brand of rural California rock into the city centers. \nThe ultimate goal of the band is to add to a great wealth of scholarship on the electric guitar and folk-country-blues-rock songwriting. Infusing the dueling guitar work of influences like Thin Lizzy and Iron Maiden with the surrealist storytelling lyrics of Townes Van Zandt\, and the countrified twang of Steve Earle\, Gill Brothers Band is the most honest and straightforward presentation of their career to date. Gill Brothers Band is an amalgamation of love and service through music made for everyone from your 2-year-old nephew to your great-grandparents. Your hips will swing\, your head will bang and your face will melt.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-gill-brothers-band-at-hopmonk-sebastopol/
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern – Sebastopol\, 230 Petaluma Ave\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.4012;-122.823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=HopMonk Tavern – Sebastopol 230 Petaluma Ave Sebastopol CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=230 Petaluma Ave:geo:-122.823,38.4012
END:VEVENT
