SUMMARY:Annie Elizabeth Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Positive Results is a stand-up show about getting a cancer diagnosis\, chasing your dreams\, and laughing at all of it — with a portion of every ticket going to the research that made it possible. Stand-up comedy about cancer\, dreams\, and why life is too short to wait!\nAnnie Elizabeth is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian currently on her debut national tour — and she’s doing it while undergoing treatment for breast cancer. \nSix months ago\, Annie was diagnosed with a rare form of breast cancer. The kind that\, not long ago\, had no good options. But\, thanks to decades of cancer research\, she has a 97% chance of survival. That news didn’t just change her prognosis — it changed everything. She quit her day job\, booked her first tour\, and decided that if life was going to be this short and this strange\, she was going to spend it doing exactly what she loves – Standup Comedy. \nPositive Results is the show that came out of all of it. It’s about getting the call no one wants\, about the absurdity of sitting in a doctor’s oﬃce and laughing anyway\, about family and fear and the reckless\, beautiful decision to finally go after your dreams. It is dark and funny and deeply human — and a portion of every ticket sold goes directly to the cancer research that saved Annie’s life. \nAnnie Elizabeth performs regularly in Los Angeles\, CA. Positive Results is her first national tour. \nTICKETS: \nPURCHASE IN ADVANCE AND SAVE!\nZones A & B ensure a seat. Zone C has limited seating\, plus standing room. \nZone A $30\nZone B $25\nZone C $20 (does not guarantee seating)\nTickets at the door $30 (Zone C only) \nDoors open 6:30pm. \nOur kitchen serves our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission. (Kitchen available only at events with 60 or more advance tickets sold)
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/annie-elizabeth-comedy/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Anne-Elizabeth-scaled.jpeg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
