SUMMARY:Pages & Pours: A Reading Night in Sonoma
DESCRIPTION:Imagine a night where you can finally sit down\, open your book\, and just… read. \nNo pressure to finish anything. No small talk you didn’t sign up for. No agenda you have to keep up with. \nJust a glass of wine\, a good story\, and a room full of people doing the exact same thing. \nPages & Pours is a low-key reading night designed for people who love books\, wine\, and a little breathing room in their week. Bring whatever you’re currently reading\, grab a glass\, and settle into a space that’s equal parts relaxing and quietly energizing. \nThe evening flows naturally: \nArrive\, ease into the night with a guided wine tasting\nFind your spot and settle in with your glass\nEnjoy a dedicated stretch of uninterrupted reading time\nOptional\, easygoing conversation—favorite lines\, current reads\, or just a quick hello\nTime to linger\, browse the book swap\, or keep reading if you’re in the zone \nThis isn’t about being “on.”\nIt’s about giving yourself a night that actually feels like yours. \nWhether you come solo or with a friend\, whether you read one page or fifty\, you’ll leave feeling a little more grounded\, a little more inspired\, and already looking forward to the next time. \nYour ticket includes a wine tasting\, a full glass of wine\, access to the book swap\, and a few extra thoughtful touches to make the night feel special. \nBring a book to swap (optional\, but encouraged).\nBring a friend (or don’t).\nJust come as you are.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pages-pours-a-reading-night-in-sonoma/
LOCATION:Ram’s Gate Winery\, 28700 Arnold Drive\, Sonoma\, 95476
CATEGORIES:Other
GEO:38.1517688;-122.4489428
